  "totalSec": 514,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Welcome.",
      "file": "c000.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.229
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "This practice is for you as a non-smoker.",
      "file": "c001.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.634
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Find a comfortable seat, or lie down if that feels better.",
      "file": "c002.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.296
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Let the hands rest.",
      "file": "c003.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.46
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Soften the eyes, or close them.",
      "file": "c004.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.949
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Take a slow breath in.",
      "file": "c005.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.833
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "And a longer breath out.",
      "file": "c006.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.651
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "[pause:16]",
      "file": "c007.ogg",
      "durationSec": 16.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Feel the body supported.",
      "file": "c008.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.786
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Nothing to prove. Nowhere to rush.",
      "file": "c009.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.228
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "[pause:16]",
      "file": "c010.ogg",
      "durationSec": 16.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "We will work with clear statements of freedom.",
      "file": "c011.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.553
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Listen, or silently repeat what lands true.",
      "file": "c012.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.831
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "[pause:18]",
      "file": "c013.ogg",
      "durationSec": 18.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "I am a non-smoker now.",
      "file": "c014.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.589
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "[pause:16]",
      "file": "c015.ogg",
      "durationSec": 16.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I am so happy to be rid of the nicotine disease.",
      "file": "c016.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.947
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "[pause:18]",
      "file": "c017.ogg",
      "durationSec": 18.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Smoking is no longer a part of my life or my identity.",
      "file": "c018.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.586
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "[pause:18]",
      "file": "c019.ogg",
      "durationSec": 18.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "I am getting these triggers because of past memories or watching other smokers.",
      "file": "c020.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.863
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "[pause:18]",
      "file": "c021.ogg",
      "durationSec": 18.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "These triggers can't do anything to me, because I have freed myself from the slavery of addiction.",
      "file": "c022.ogg",
      "durationSec": 6.989
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "[pause:22]",
      "file": "c023.ogg",
      "durationSec": 22.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "I feel sorry for smokers who are still stuck with their smoking deceptions.",
      "file": "c024.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.503
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Who are trapped in the miserable cycle of nicotine depletion, urge, and refilling.",
      "file": "c025.ogg",
      "durationSec": 5.782
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "[pause:18]",
      "file": "c026.ogg",
      "durationSec": 18.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "I don't suffer like them anymore.",
      "file": "c027.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.995
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "[pause:14]",
      "file": "c028.ogg",
      "durationSec": 14.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Now I know the truth.",
      "file": "c029.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.426
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "There is absolutely no benefit of smoking.",
      "file": "c030.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.506
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "[pause:18]",
      "file": "c031.ogg",
      "durationSec": 18.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "The urine stick has never helped anyone, and it never will.",
      "file": "c032.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.667
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "[pause:18]",
      "file": "c033.ogg",
      "durationSec": 18.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Smoking has created a lot of problems for me.",
      "file": "c034.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.551
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "[pause:14]",
      "file": "c035.ogg",
      "durationSec": 14.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "I took the best decision of my life to never smoke another puff of that disgusting poison.",
      "file": "c036.ogg",
      "durationSec": 6.742
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "That decision was final.",
      "file": "c037.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.589
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "[pause:22]",
      "file": "c038.ogg",
      "durationSec": 22.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Now, I respect the Law of Smoking.",
      "file": "c039.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.112
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "[pause:18]",
      "file": "c040.ogg",
      "durationSec": 18.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Now, all my situations are getting better.",
      "file": "c041.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.62
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "I am becoming happier, healthier, and more confident.",
      "file": "c042.ogg",
      "durationSec": 4.11
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "[pause:22]",
      "file": "c043.ogg",
      "durationSec": 22.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "I am free.",
      "file": "c044.ogg",
      "durationSec": 1.997
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "[pause:28]",
      "file": "c045.ogg",
      "durationSec": 28.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Rest in that freedom for a few breaths.",
      "file": "c046.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.588
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Triggers may still visit as old memory.",
      "file": "c047.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.634
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "They cannot return you to slavery.",
      "file": "c048.ogg",
      "durationSec": 3.146
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "[pause:36]",
      "file": "c049.ogg",
      "durationSec": 36.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "I am a non-smoker now.",
      "file": "c050.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.705
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "I am free.",
      "file": "c051.ogg",
      "durationSec": 1.916
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "[pause:28]",
      "file": "c052.ogg",
      "durationSec": 28.0,
      "silence": true
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Take one more easy breath.",
      "file": "c053.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.427
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Wiggle the fingers.",
      "file": "c054.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.464
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "When you are ready, open the eyes.",
      "file": "c055.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.995
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Carry this freedom with you.",
      "file": "c056.ogg",
      "durationSec": 2.705
    }
